CirrusSearch: accept OpenSearch 2.x

The REL1_46 version gate accepts only OpenSearch 1.3.x, which has been EOL
since May 2025. Support for 2.x is already upstream in 03f64ca0 but was not
backported to the release branch. WMF is on 2.19.5 as a step toward 3.x.

Upstream: https://phabricator.wikimedia.org/T421757 (1.x -> 2.x, 1.x unmaintained)
          https://phabricator.wikimedia.org/T420407 (2.19.5 on the path to 3.x)
Drop:     at MediaWiki 1.47, where the gate accepts 2.x.

--- a/extensions/CirrusSearch/includes/Maintenance/ConfigUtils.php
+++ b/extensions/CirrusSearch/includes/Maintenance/ConfigUtils.php
@@ -47,7 +47,7 @@
 		$version = $banner['version']['number'];
 		$this->output( "$distribution $version..." );
 
-		$required = $distribution === 'opensearch' ? '1.3' : '7.10';
+		$required = $distribution === 'opensearch' ? '2.' : '7.10';
 		if ( strpos( $version, $required ) !== 0 ) {
 			$this->output( "Not supported!\n" );
 			return Status::newFatal(
